question:
Implement GEMM dimension preprocessing for cuBLAS algorithm selection.

Your function should:
1. Compute the next power of two for the n dimension (used in algorithm lookup)
2. Determine if sparse GEMM can be used (dimensions must be multiples of 8)

The function signature is in include/solution_header.h.

Use the bit manipulation pattern from the seed:
  --v;
  v |= v >> 1;
  v |= v >> 2;
  v |= v >> 4;
  v |= v >> 8;
  v |= v >> 16;
  return ++v;

